      'This mean reduces some of the noise from any one round drawing an unusually hard or easy batch, so we put it first in the results section. It is not a same-task exam or a complete estimate of generalization: the tasks vary across the 20 rounds, and all measurements remain within WebShop.',
    )}</p>

    <h3>4.2 {t('固定 128 题终评：三组同题，但它只是一套题', 'Fixed 128-task final: same tasks for all three, but still only one panel')}</h3>
    <div class="paper-table-wrap">
      <table class="paper-table">
        <thead><tr><th>{t('实验', 'Experiment')}</th><th>Task Score / 100</th><th>{t('完整做对', 'Exact success')}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
