          'This table belongs only to the preregistered long-horizon contrast between Bounded and β-gating (α=1). The positive mean-reward difference is a transient signal; the interval crosses zero and exact success does not improve, so it cannot be described as a stable long-horizon gain. It also does not answer what dynamic α + dynamic β would do.',
