  <section class="paper__section" id="analysis" aria-labelledby="analysis-title">
    <p class="paper__section-number">5</p>
    <h2 id="analysis-title">{t('指标分析：从 loss 一直看到行为 entropy', 'Metric analysis: from loss to behavioral entropy')}</h2>
    <p class="paper__lede">{t(
      '这里不再把 Task Vector、范数、长度和 entropy 混成一段。我们按指标复杂度往下走：先看训练有没有正常优化，再看参数怎么变，最后才看行为分布怎么变。每一节都固定回答三件事：这个指标是什么、这次实验测到了什么、我们能怎么解释。',
      'Instead of mixing Task Vector, norms, length, and entropy together, we move from simpler to richer diagnostics: optimization first, then parameter change, then behavior. Every subsection answers the same three questions: what the metric is, what this experiment measured, and how far the interpretation can go.',
