      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="paper__metric-step" id="parameter-geometry">
      <h3>5.3 {t('参数范数、谱与方向：再往里看“状态长什么样”', 'Parameter norms, spectrum, and direction: what does the state geometry look like?')}</h3>
