            <tr><td>Final State · max spectral norm</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.off.finalStateMaxSpectral.toFixed(3)}</td><td><strong>{study.parameterAnalysis.on.finalStateMaxSpectral.toFixed(3)}</strong></td></tr>
            <tr><td>Final Task Vector · Frobenius</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.off.finalTaskVectorFrobenius.toFixed(3)}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.on.finalTaskVectorFrobenius.toFixed(3)}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Final Task Vector · max spectral norm</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.off.finalTaskVectorMaxSpectral.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.on.finalTaskVectorMaxSpectral.toFixed(4)}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>full/base spectral ratio · median</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.off.fullToBaseSpectralRatioMedian.toFixed(6)}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.on.fullToBaseSpectralRatioMedian.toFixed(6)}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>rank95 · median</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.off.rank95Median}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.on.rank95Median}</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p>{t('R159 的更新 norm 比例（β-gating / Bounded）', 'R159 update-norm ratio (β-gating / Bounded)')}: <strong>{(study.posthocAnalysis.directionMagnitudeR159.updateNormRatioOnOff * 100).toFixed(1)}%</strong> · cosine: <strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.directionMagnitudeR159.updateCosineOnOff.toFixed(3)}</strong> · {t('第 19–27 层平均 cosine', 'mean cosine over layers 19–27')}: <strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.directionMagnitudeR159.lateLayerUpdateCosineMean.toFixed(3)}</strong></p>
      <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('③ 分析', '③ Analysis')}</p>
      <p class="paper__boundary">{t(
        'β-gating 确实得到一个更小、稍低 rank 的长期 State，但“更小”没有自动换来更高分。更值得注意的是方向已经明显分开：它不是简单把同一个更新乘一个小系数。不过锚点仍然很少，所以还不能说这种几何分开就是掉分原因。',
        'β-gating does produce a smaller, slightly lower-rank long-term State, but smaller does not automatically mean better. More importantly, the update direction itself diverges; this is not merely the same update multiplied by a smaller scalar. The anchor count is still small, so the geometric divergence is not yet a demonstrated cause of the score drop.',
      )}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="paper__metric-step" id="length">
      <h3>5.4 {t('输出长度与任务步数：从参数走到实际做题路径', 'Output length and task steps: moving from parameters to behavior')}</h3>
      <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('① 指标是什么', '① What are the metrics?')}</p>
      <p>{t(
        '这里看三层：每一步输出多少 token、整个 episode 一共输出多少 token、完成一题用了多少个动作步骤。前两个看回答长度，最后一个更接近“模型走了多长的购物路径”。',
        'We use three levels: tokens per step, total tokens per episode, and action steps per task. The first two measure response length; the last is closer to the length of the shopping trajectory the model actually takes.',
      )}</p>
      <MetricEvidenceFigure item={metricCharts.steps} />
      <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('② 这次实验的结果', '② Result in this experiment')}</p>
      <div class="paper-table-wrap">
        <table class="paper-table paper-table--dense-results">
          <thead><tr><th>{t('方法 / 窗口', 'Method / window')}</th><th>{t('每步输出', 'tokens / step')}</th><th>{t('Episode 总输出', 'episode tokens')}</th><th>{t('平均步骤', 'steps')}</th><th>Task Score</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>{names.baseline} · R0–31</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlyStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlyEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlySteps.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlyScore.toFixed(3)}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>{names.baseline} · R128–159</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateSteps.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateScore.toFixed(3)}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>{names.bounded} · R0–31</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.earlyStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.earlyEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.earlySteps.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.earlyScore.toFixed(3)}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>{names.bounded} · R128–159</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.lateStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.lateEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.lateSteps.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.lateScore.toFixed(3)}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>{names.gdr} · R0–31</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.earlyStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.earlyEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.earlySteps.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.earlyScore.toFixed(3)}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>{names.gdr} · R128–159</td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateSteps.toFixed(2)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateScore.toFixed(3)}</strong></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p>{t('β-gating（α=1）在 R96–127 → R128–159：', 'β-gating (α=1), R96–127 → R128–159:')} {t('每步 tokens', 'tokens/step')} <strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midStepTokens.toFixed(1)} → {study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong> · {t('episode tokens', 'episode tokens')} <strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)} → {study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong> · {t('平均步骤', 'mean steps')} <strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midSteps.toFixed(2)} → {study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateSteps.toFixed(2)}</strong> · Task Score <strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midScore.toFixed(3)} → {study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateScore.toFixed(3)}</strong></p>
      <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('③ 分析', '③ Analysis')}</p>
      <p class="paper__boundary">{t(
        '所以后期掉分不是“每一步突然更啰嗦”。更直接的行为变化是：每一步长度差不多，但要走更多步才能结束任务，整条路径又变长了。这比单看参数 norm 更接近实际任务行为。',
        'The late drop is therefore not “each step suddenly becomes more verbose.” The clearer behavioral change is that individual steps stay similar in length while the task requires more steps, making the overall trajectory longer. This sits closer to actual task behavior than parameter norm alone.',
      )}</p>
      <p class="paper__links"><a href="/research/seed-openevo/evidence/wandb-threeway/output-length-analysis.json">{t('160 轮完整长度 / 步数 JSON →', 'Full 160-round length / step JSON →')}</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="paper__metric-step" id="entropy">
      <h3>5.5 Entropy：{t('最后看策略行为是不是越来越集中', 'finally, is policy behavior becoming more concentrated?')}</h3>
      <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('① 指标是什么', '① What is the metric?')}</p>
      <p>{t(
        '这里能可靠重建的是 action-family Shannon entropy：把 search、click 等有效动作类型的分布压成一个数。entropy 越低，表示策略越来越集中在少数几类动作上。它不是语言模型的 token entropy，因为正式 rollout 没有保存逐 token logits / logprobs。',
        'What can be reconstructed reliably is action-family Shannon entropy over valid action types such as search and click. Lower entropy means the policy is concentrating on fewer action families. This is not language-model token entropy because the formal rollouts did not persist per-token logits/logprobs.',
      )}</p>
      <MetricEvidenceFigure item={metricCharts.entropy} />
      <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('② 这次实验的结果', '② Result in this experiment')}</p>
      <div class="paper-table-wrap">
        <table class="paper-table paper-table--dense-results">
          <thead><tr><th>{t('方法', 'Method')}</th><th>R0–31 mean H</th><th>R128–159 mean H</th><th>R159 H</th><th>R159 search</th><th>R159 click</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>{names.baseline}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.ordinaryEarly.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.ordinaryLate.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.ordinary.entropy.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.ordinary.search}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.ordinary.click}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>{names.bounded}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.boundedEarly.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.boundedLate.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.bounded.entropy.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.bounded.search}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.bounded.click}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>{names.gdr}</td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.gdrEarly.toFixed(4)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.gdrLate.toFixed(4)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.entropy.toFixed(4)}</strong></td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.search}</td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.click}</strong></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('③ 分析', '③ Analysis')}</p>
      <p class="paper__boundary">{t('β-gating（α=1）的行为 entropy 明显下降，而且 R159 的有效动作更集中在 click；三组 valid action rate 都是 100%。这说明变化来自有效策略行为本身越来越集中，不是 parser 错误。但它和掉分只是同时出现，目前不能写成“低 entropy 导致掉分”。', 'For β-gating (α=1), action entropy falls substantially and R159 valid actions are more concentrated on click; valid-action rate is 100% for all three methods. The policy itself is becoming more concentrated rather than failing parsing, but this remains a co-occurrence rather than evidence that low entropy causes the score drop.')}</p>
      <p class="paper__links"><a href="/research/seed-openevo/evidence/wandb-threeway/action-family-entropy.json">{t('160 轮完整行为 entropy JSON →', 'Full 160-round action-entropy JSON →')}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="paper__section" id="next-question" aria-labelledby="next-question-title">
    <p class="paper__section-number">6</p>
    <h2 id="next-question-title">{t('动态 α + 动态 β：尚未运行', 'Dynamic α + dynamic β: not run yet')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      '这条指标链给出的顺序很清楚：loss 说明优化过程不是简单坏掉；Task Vector 和参数谱说明参数轨迹确实发生了几何变化；长度、步数和 entropy 才开始看到更接近任务行为的变化。但这些后分析都不能补上一个根本缺口：这次正式实验始终固定 α=1。',
      'The diagnostic ladder gives a clear sequence: loss says optimization did not simply fail; Task Vector and parameter spectrum show real geometric divergence; length, steps, and entropy reveal changes closer to task behavior. None of these post-hoc analyses fill the basic missing experiment: α remained fixed at 1 throughout this formal study.',
    )}</p>
    <p>{t(
      '所以第一条新实验应该是动态 α + 动态 β；它现在仍然是空位。第二条问题才是 β controller 还应该知道什么，例如 layer、round 或历史更新方向。已经看过的 Final 不能反过来用来调当前封存实验。',
      'The first new experiment should therefore be dynamic α + dynamic β, which remains an empty slot. Only after that comes the question of what additional information the β controller should observe, such as layer, round, or historical update direction. The completed Final cannot be used retrospectively to tune this sealed experiment.',
    )}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="paper__section" id="evidence" aria-labelledby="evidence-title">
    <p class="paper__section-number">7</p>
    <h2 id="evidence-title">{t('证据与复现身份', 'Evidence and reproducibility identity')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      '正文把已完成的第三组明确写成“Bounded Online Recurrence + β-gating（α=1）”，不再把它当作完整 GDR。“动态 α + 动态 β”只作为未做实验位置保留。为了审计，底层正式身份仍原样保留：普通 OpenEVO 对应历史 DirectApply / No-GDR；后两组正式实验标识仍是 BOUNDED_OFF 与 EFFECTIVE_STATE_GDR_LORA_V1。',
      'The completed third line is named explicitly as “Bounded Online Recurrence + β-gating (α=1)” rather than presented as full GDR. Dynamic α + dynamic β is kept only as an unrun slot. For auditability, the underlying formal identities remain unchanged: ordinary OpenEVO maps to the historical DirectApply / No-GDR run, and the matched formal identities remain BOUNDED_OFF and EFFECTIVE_STATE_GDR_LORA_V1.',
    )}</p>
    <details class="paper__details paper__experiment-hub" data-experiment-hub>
      <summary>{t('本实验的结果、分析与证据', 'Results, analysis, and evidence for this experiment')}</summary>
      <p data-hub-motivation><strong>{t('为什么做：', 'Why this experiment: ')}</strong>{experiment.motivation[locale]}</p>
      <div class="paper__hub-grid">
        <div data-hub-group="result">
          <h3>{t('结果', 'Result')}</h3>
          <ul>{hubResults.map((link) => <li><a href={p(link.href)}>{link.label[locale]}</a></li>)}</ul>
        </div>
        <div data-hub-group="analysis">
          <h3>{t('分析', 'Analysis')}</h3>
          <ul>{hubAnalyses.map((link) => <li><a href={p(link.href)}>{link.label[locale]}</a></li>)}</ul>
        </div>
        <div data-hub-group="evidence">
          <h3>{t('证据 / 历史', 'Evidence / history')}</h3>
          <ul>{hubEvidence.map((link) => <li><a href={p(link.href)}>{link.label[locale]}</a></li>)}</ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="paper__details" open>
      <summary>{t('正式结果与同题 Final', 'Formal results and same-panel final')}</summary>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.finalComparison}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.finalComparison} />{t('三组同题冻结终评 / Bounded Online Recurrence 与 β-gating（α=1）正式比较', 'three-way same-panel final / formal Bounded Online Recurrence vs β-gating (α=1) comparison')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.longHorizon}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.longHorizon} />{t('长期统计与 bootstrap', 'long-horizon statistics and bootstrap')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.publicSnapshot}>{t('公开机器可读结果快照', 'public machine-readable snapshot')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.posthocAnalysis.snapshot}>{t('只读后分析快照', 'read-only post-hoc snapshot')}</a></li>
      </ul>
    </details>
    <details class="paper__details">
      <summary>{t('方法实现与资格证据', 'Method implementation and qualification evidence')}</summary>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.gaugeInvariantPolicy}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.gaugeInvariantPolicy} />gauge-invariant β policy</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.stepTrace}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.stepTrace} />exact per-step trace</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.finalCloseout}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.finalCloseout} />{t('最终收口记录', 'final closeout')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={directApplyHref}>{t('普通 OpenEVO 独立实验页', 'ordinary OpenEVO experiment')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={boundedHref}>{t('Bounded State 早期研究页', 'Bounded State research page')}</a></li>
      </ul>
    </details>
  </section>
</article>

